  ('Christ University Entrance Test', 'cutoffs', 'estimate', 'Christ does not publish cutoffs. Selection combines the entrance test, a skills assessment (e.g. group discussion or micro-presentation) and a personal interview.', 'Based on typical cutoffs and closing ranks in recent years. Actual cutoffs change every year with paper difficulty, seats and category.', null, null, null, null),
