  ('kvs-teacher', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: PRT — Class 12 + D.El.Ed/B.El.Ed with CTET Paper I; TGT — degree + B.Ed with CTET Paper II; PGT — master''s + B.Ed.
