  ('bank-probationary-officer-po', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: any bachelor''s degree; age 20–30.
Route: IBPS PO or SBI PO exams (Prelims → Mains → Interview).', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('business-manager', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a bachelor''s degree; an MBA is common.
Route: CAT/XAT/GMAT/MAT/CMAT → MBA → management trainee roles; or rise through a company''s operations or sales.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('chartered-accountant', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (CA Foundation) or a graduate with the required marks (direct entry to Intermediate).
Route: ICAI''s CA Foundation → Intermediate → 2-year articleship → CA Final → ICAI membership.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('entrepreneur', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'No fixed eligibility. Common path: a degree (often engineering or business), a few years'' work experience, then a startup — often via incubators (IIT/IIM incubators, Startup India) and early-stage funding.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('financial-analyst', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a degree in commerce, economics, finance or engineering.
Route: an MBA (Finance), CFA or FRM → analyst roles in banks, investment firms or corporate finance.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('hr-manager', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: any bachelor''s degree.
Route: MBA/PGDM in HR (via CAT, XAT or TISS/XLRI admissions) → HR executive roles → HR manager.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('investment-banker', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a degree in commerce, economics or engineering.
Route: an MBA from a top B-school (via CAT/GMAT) or CA/CFA → analyst/associate roles in investment banks.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('marketing-manager', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: any bachelor''s degree.
Route: MBA/PGDM in Marketing (CAT, XAT, MAT, CMAT) → brand, sales or digital marketing roles → manager.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('chef', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream).
Route: B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration (NCHM JEE for IHMs) or a culinary diploma/degree → commis chef in hotel kitchens → chef de partie → sous chef → head chef.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('hotel-manager', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream) with English.
Route: B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration (via NCHM JEE for IHMs) or BHM → management trainee programmes in hotel chains.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('content-creator', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'No fixed eligibility. Build skills in writing, video and editing, publish consistently on a platform (YouTube, Instagram, blogs) and grow an audience; brand deals and platform revenue follow.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('fashion-designer', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream).
Route: B.Des in Fashion Design via the NIFT entrance, NID DAT, UCEED or private design school tests → portfolio → design house or own label.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('film-director', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 or a degree.
Route: FTII/SRFTI (via JET) or other film schools, or assisting directors on sets → short films → feature work.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('graphic-designer', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream).
Route: B.Des/B.F.A. or a design diploma → tools (Adobe Suite, Figma) and a portfolio → studio or agency roles.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('interior-designer', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream).
Route: B.Des/B.Sc in Interior Design (NID, CEPT, private schools) or a diploma → internships → design firms or own practice.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('journalist', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream).
