  ('performing-artist', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'No fixed eligibility. Formal training (NSD, music/dance universities such as IKSV, or a guru) plus auditions and stage work.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('textile-designer', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 (any stream).
Route: B.Des in Textile Design via NIFT/NID entrances or private schools → textile mills, export houses or fashion brands.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('curriculum-developer', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a subject degree plus B.Ed/M.Ed.
Route: teaching experience → curriculum roles in boards, publishers or edtech firms.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('edtech-entrepreneur', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'No fixed eligibility. Usual path: teaching or tech experience → a learning product → incubators and funding.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('education-consultant', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a degree; M.Ed or counselling qualifications help.
Route: teaching or admissions counselling experience → consultancies or independent practice.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('educational-psychologist', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: M.A./M.Sc Psychology (educational/school psychology).
Route: school counselling roles; RCI-recognised qualifications for assessment work.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('librarian', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a bachelor''s degree.
Route: B.Lib.I.Sc and M.Lib.I.Sc → UGC-NET for college/university librarian posts; KVS/NVS/school librarian posts via their exams.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('online-course-creator', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'No fixed eligibility. Subject expertise, teaching ability and video skills → publish on platforms (Udemy, YouTube, own site).', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('professor', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a master''s degree with 55% (50% for reserved categories).
Route: UGC-NET (or CSIR-NET/SLET) → Assistant Professor posts; a PhD is needed for promotion and many universities.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('school-principal', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a master''s degree with B.Ed and usually 8–15 years'' teaching experience.
Route: promotion from senior teacher, or KVS/NVS/state principal recruitment exams.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('social-worker', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: a bachelor''s degree (BSW preferred).
Route: MSW (TISS via CUET-PG, Delhi School of Social Work, Nirmala Niketan) → NGOs, CSR, hospitals and government schemes.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('special-education-teacher', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12 for D.Ed (Special Education); a degree for B.Ed (Special Education).
