  ('sports-coach', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: Class 12; sports achievements help.
Route: B.P.Ed/M.P.Ed (e.g. LNIPE) or NIS Patiala coaching diploma → coaching posts with SAI, schools, clubs.', 'Based on the usual eligibility and entry routes for this career in India.', null, null, null, null),
  ('air-traffic-controller', 'how_to_enter', 'estimate', 'Eligibility: B.Sc with Physics and Maths, or B.E./B.Tech.
